# Place release .dmg files here.
# Filename convention: localVoiceRec-<version>.dmg
# These are typically NOT committed to git — upload to Cloudflare Pages
# via either:
#   (a) git LFS (set up separately)
#   (b) direct upload to the Cloudflare Pages assets via `wrangler pages deploy`
#   (c) external CDN linked via the download button
#
# For development, you can copy from dist/:
#   cp ../../dist/localVoiceRec-0.1.0.dmg .
